    "gp_section_519288784651551534": {
      "type": "gp-section-519288784651551534",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "63a10fb2cc8e7e8e5126fa3652ce3f98f89d8366ffe0c68bb4b7b4993de7eb4b_1_1_0_0__1",
        "ggkb0MJqD7g_text": "Pure Shilajit Gold Resin",
        "ggOB-gq8v9d_text": "<p>4.9/5*</p>",
        "ggIeUvHyvgB_text": "<p>1800+ reviews</p>",
        "ggH5-kN9iHr_text": "<p>The Pure Himalayan Gold Shilajit Promise</p>",
        "ggHuft5Qw8G_text": "<p>High in the Himalayas, where nature transcends into legend, we source the rarest elixir – Shilajit Gold Resin. Infused with the purest trace gold, this treasure is born from altitudes exceeding 17,000ft. Each batch is meticulously tested by Eurofin, ensuring unmatched potency and an abundance of fulvic acid. We honor the wisdom of Ayurveda, carefully sun-drying the resin to preserve its extraordinary essence.</p>",
        "ggds71aoV_-_text": "<p>Our unwavering commitment is to provide this pinnacle of nature's bounty. Transparency guides our path – from the mountain peaks to your well-being. Experience the transformative power of Pure Himalayan Gold Shilajit, a testament to Earth's most precious gifts and our dedication to your health.</p>",
        "ggR9bkBU3E1_text": "Deandra",
        "ggWc2vw8FsC_text": "Icky taste but worth getting used to it.",
        "ggfBqHYsFUg_text": "<p>Became interested in Shilajit while visiting friends who do not normally have a big interest in Ayurveda. On investigation and casual inquiry I decided to at least try it. Liked that the product came with laboratory endorsement for purity from heavy metals and for the fulvic acid quality (+75%). Thought the taste was not so much bad as it was more \"earthy\" and the pea sized dose was very manageable. In fact I clearly felt a buzz of well-being and energy but off the 3 of us trying it out I was the only one willing to mention that. All in all will be continuing to explore the benefits of Shilajit.</p>",
        "ggCkm0HtloG_text": "Alex",
        "ggUq_hB7D5Y_text": "<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong>Best of the best!</strong></span>",
        "ggefN5Lf0py_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Immediate energy for me when taking it right before a workout+</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Here are a list of benefits I noticed:</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">*Increased grip strength, I find myself being able to really get a strong grip on my weights</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">*Increased strength: finding it easier to increase weight on all my lifts week by week</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">*Noticing increased muscle size and great pumps. (keep in mind if your going for muscle gains and your curing 5 pounds your going to look like someone who curls 5, if you curl 50 your going to look like someone who curls 50s this supplement will help you increase your goals every week, but you need to put in the work, you don't take the supplement and watch Netflix and expect muscle gains.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">*Faster recovery and repair</span></p>",
        "ggp-1sSvCrb_text": "Mathew",
        "ggWlIsCTdVN_text": "Shilajit is the cheatcode for life",
        "ggeyRHSCNWo_text": "<p>I've tried several Shilajit brands from Amazon, but Pure Himalayan Shilajit Gold stands out significantly. Its liquid form makes it easy to mix into my coffee, ensuring I get every drop of its goodness. Unlike others, it has a unique taste and smell, testament to its high fulvic acid content—lab-tested at over 75%—and rare gold traces that no other brand offers. This &nbsp;not only boosts energy but also offer greater health benefits. The packaging, though ample, is essential to protect these unique qualities. I'm definitely sticking with this for the health perks it brings!</p>",
        "gg6ru4QQTK5_label": "<p>SUPERCHARGE YOUR HEALTH</p>",
        "ggbsnQ1pHrN_text": "<p>100% Secured Checkout Guarenteed&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggBycHsxQHT_text": "<p>Ships by <strong>Mon, 25 Mar</strong></p>",
        "ggMvuuJFbcg_text": "<p><strong>16 orders</strong> at this price remaining</p>"
      }
    },
